{
  "name": "00 - Single-group migration baseline (v1 → v2, 2-node)",
  "description": "2-node end-to-end baseline migration. Node 1 (admin) installs migration-suite-v1, creates a namespace + one Open subgroup + one context in the subgroup, invites node 2 via namespace invitation, node 2 materialises subgroup membership via inheritance + joins the context. Node 1 writes v1 state, waits for node 2 to catch up, then runs upgrade_group on the subgroup (per-context, cascade=false) and the node resolves migrate_v1_to_v2 from the target bundle's embedded ABI. Asserts the Migrated event + v2 schema shape on node 1 AND mirrors the post-migration schema_info on node 2 to prove cross-node convergence via context-sync gossip.\nActs as the regression guard for Root<T> merge semantics: a change there once broke write_migration_state's save_raw call with MergeFailure(NoMergeFunctionRegistered), which this workflow catches at the upgrade_group step.\n",
  "comment": [
    "Migrated from this file's v1 workflow by `merobox cloud port`.",
    "Each of the original scenario's nodes is an account here; see merobox/cloud_v2/port.py for the mapping.",
    "Dropped (no counterpart in this node):",
    "  assert_migration_complete x1: v1 group migration",
    "  delete_context (unknown) x1: checks what the dropped steps did",
    "  delete_namespace x1: v1 namespace deletion",
    "  get_group_upgrade_status (unknown) x1: checks what the dropped steps did",
    "  get_migration_status output (v1 per-member rollup) x7: checks what the dropped steps did",
    "  json_assert statement on a dropped step's output x9: checks what the dropped steps did",
    "  uninstall_application (unknown) x1: checks what the dropped steps did",
    "  wait_for_sync x2: replication is synchronous: a read sees every committed write",
    "Fixed in the migration (converter bugs): a cascade upgrade_group",
    "upgrades every app in the namespace's teams; of get_migration_status",
    "only the outputs that mean the same here are kept.",
    "Migration note: converter bug: get_group_upgrade_status is unknown to it, so it drops",
    "  the step but keeps the asserts on its outputs; the record is the org's upgrade run",
    "Migration note: same converter bug: v1's status completed + toVersion 2.0.0 is the",
    "  run's finished, no failures, every covered app done, version 2.0.0"
  ],
  "cluster": {
    "nodes": 3
  },
  "accounts": [
    "app-migration-baseline-1",
    "app-migration-baseline-2"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "Install migration-suite-v1 on node 1",
      "type": "install_package",
      "mpk": "{{env.CORE_WASM_DIR}}/dist/com.calimero.migration-suite-1.0.0.mpk",
      "outputs": {
        "app_v1": "package",
        "app_v1_version": "version"
      },
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Create namespace on node 1",
      "type": "create_org",
      "org_name": "Create namespace on node 1",
      "outputs": {
        "namespace_id": "orgId"
      },
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Open subgroup on node 1",
      "type": "create_team",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team_name": "baseline-migration",
      "join": "invite",
      "outputs": {
        "group_id": "teamId"
      },
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mark subgroup as Open",
      "type": "team_update",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{group_id}}",
      "join": "everyone",
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Create context in subgroup on node 1 (v1)",
      "type": "deploy",
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1",
      "package": "{{app_v1}}",
      "version": "{{app_v1_version}}",
      "app_name": "Create context in subgroup on node 1 (v1)",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "access": {
        "kind": "team",
        "team": "{{group_id}}"
      },
      "outputs": {
        "ctx_id": "contextId"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Create namespace invitation for node 2",
      "type": "invite",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "role": "member",
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1",
      "outputs": {
        "namespace_invitation": "token"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Node 2 joins namespace",
      "type": "redeem_invite",
      "token": "{{namespace_invitation}}",
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-2"
    },
    {
      "name": "Node 2 materialises subgroup membership via inheritance",
      "type": "team_join",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{group_id}}",
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-2"
    },
    {
      "name": "Set description (v1)",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set_description",
      "args": {
        "description": "set-before-migration"
      },
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Increment counter (v1)",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "increment_counter",
      "args": {},
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Read v1 schema_info on node 1 (sanity)",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "schema_info",
      "args": {},
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1",
      "outputs": {
        "v1_schema": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert v1 schema before migration",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_subset({{v1_schema}}, {\"output\": {\"schema_version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"set-before-migration\", \"counter\": \"1\"}})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Install migration-suite-v2-add-field on node 1",
      "type": "install_package",
      "mpk": "{{env.CORE_WASM_DIR}}/dist/com.calimero.migration-suite-2.0.0.mpk",
      "outputs": {
        "app_v2": "package",
        "app_v2_version": "version"
      },
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert both versions share one application id (bundle same-id)",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "equal(\"{{app_v1}}\", \"{{app_v2}}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Upgrade with migrate_v1_to_v2",
      "type": "http",
      "method": "post",
      "path": "orgs/{{namespace_id}}/upgrade",
      "body": {
        "package": "{{app_v2}}",
        "version": "{{app_v2_version}}",
        "team": "{{group_id}}"
      },
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1",
      "outputs": {
        "up_run": "runId"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Wait for upgrade + migration to apply + log flush",
      "type": "wait",
      "seconds": 15.0
    },
    {
      "name": "Read the subgroup's upgrade record",
      "type": "http",
      "method": "get",
      "path": "orgs/{{namespace_id}}/upgrades/{{up_run}}",
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1",
      "outputs": {
        "up_record": ".",
        "up_apps": "apps",
        "up_done": "done"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert the record names the v2 target",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_subset({{up_record}}, {\"version\": \"2.0.0\", \"finished\": true, \"failed\": {}})",
        "json_equal({{up_done}}, {{up_apps}})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Read post-migration schema_info on node 1 (triggers lazy migration)",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "schema_info",
      "args": {},
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1",
      "outputs": {
        "v2_schema_node1": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Read post-migration schema_info on node 2 (triggers lazy migration)",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "schema_info",
      "args": {},
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-2",
      "outputs": {
        "v2_schema_node2": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Read the migration-status rollup on node 1 (admin)",
      "type": "migration_status",
      "apps": [
        "{{ctx_id}}"
      ],
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1",
      "outputs": {
        "mig_failed": "failed"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert each member migrated its own state, with no residue left",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "equal({{mig_failed}}, 0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert v2 schema on node 1 (v1 data preserved + notes seeded)",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_subset({{v2_schema_node1}}, {\"output\": {\"schema_version\": \"2.0.0\"}})",
        "json_subset({{v2_schema_node1}}, {\"output\": {\"description\": \"set-before-migration\", \"counter\": \"1\"}})",
        "json_subset({{v2_schema_node1}}, {\"output\": {\"notes\": \"added in v2\"}})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert v2 schema on node 2 (same shape, proves migration reached node 2)",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_subset({{v2_schema_node2}}, {\"output\": {\"schema_version\": \"2.0.0\"}})",
        "json_subset({{v2_schema_node2}}, {\"output\": {\"description\": \"set-before-migration\", \"counter\": \"1\"}})",
        "json_subset({{v2_schema_node2}}, {\"output\": {\"notes\": \"added in v2\"}})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Node 1 calls v2-only setter set_notes",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "set_notes",
      "args": {
        "notes": "written-post-migration"
      },
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    },
    {
      "name": "Node 2 reads notes via v2 getter",
      "type": "call",
      "app": "{{ctx_id}}",
      "method": "get_notes",
      "args": {},
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-2",
      "outputs": {
        "notes_after_node2": "rpc"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Assert v2-only write reached node 2",
      "type": "json_assert",
      "statements": [
        "json_equal({{notes_after_node2}}, {\"output\": \"written-post-migration\"})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Delete subgroup",
      "type": "team_delete",
      "org": "{{namespace_id}}",
      "team": "{{group_id}}",
      "account": "app-migration-baseline-1"
    }
  ]
}
